Refused
-------

  Triangle (Shewchuk triangulator)   Commercial use restricted; GPL-incompatible.
                                     Use CDT or CGAL. Shewchuk's predicates.c is a
                                     separate, freely usable file and IS required.

  ODA Drawings SDK                   Closed source; GPL-incompatible. DWG support
                                     is bounded by LibreDWG quality, and that is
                                     recorded as the project's largest technical
                                     risk (piricad.md §9.8, §15).

  Any GPLv2-only dependency          Incompatible with the Apache-2.0 components
                                     this project depends on (piricad.md §1).
